WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.046 --> 00:00:16.638
"Oh no!" Tom yelled.

2
00:00:16.639 --> 00:00:21.688
The trout was very strong.

3
00:00:21.689 --> 00:00:25.927
It flopped back into the water.

4
00:00:25.927 --> 00:00:29.632
Jeremy's rod flew through the air.

5
00:00:29.632 --> 00:00:32.460
So did Jeremy and Tom!

6
00:00:32.461 --> 00:00:45.258
Splash! Splash!

7
00:00:45.258 --> 00:00:49.833
Tom and Jeremy climbed back on the boat.

8
00:00:49.834 --> 00:00:53.702
Tom looked at his wet clothes.

9
00:00:53.702 --> 00:00:59.287
"Mother will be very angry," he said.

10
00:00:59.288 --> 00:01:03.570
Jeremy started paddling the boat again.

11
00:01:03.571 --> 00:01:07.407
"I don't like fishing," Tom said.

12
00:01:07.407 --> 00:01:10.785
"Me neither," Jeremy said.

13
00:01:10.786 --> 00:01:14.122
"Shall we look for flowers now?"

14
00:01:14.122 --> 00:01:16.659
Tom looked down.

15
00:01:16.659 --> 00:01:23.355
His clothes were a mess.

16
00:01:23.356 --> 00:01:28.993
"Oh, I have another idea!" he said.

17
00:01:28.994 --> 00:01:39.101
Tom ran home.

18
00:01:39.106 --> 00:01:43.054
Mrs. Twitchit's friends were there.

19
00:01:43.055 --> 00:01:49.906
Everyone was sipping tea.

20
00:01:49.907 --> 00:01:54.002
"Tom!" Mrs. Twitchit said.

21
00:01:54.003 --> 00:01:55.913
"You're all wet.

22
00:01:55.913 --> 00:01:58.728
And where are the flowers?"

23
00:01:58.729 --> 00:02:01.100
Tom smiled.

24
00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:04.807
"I couldn't find any flowers, Mother.

25
00:02:04.807 --> 00:02:07.665
But I have a better surprise."

26
00:02:07.665 --> 00:02:10.866
Tom reached into his pocket.

27
00:02:10.867 --> 00:02:15.554
He pulled out . . . wiggling worms!

28
00:02:15.554 --> 00:02:20.641
Mittens and Moppet giggled.

29
00:02:20.642 --> 00:02:25.855
Mrs. Twitchit's friends laughed.

30
00:02:25.856 --> 00:02:36.299
Everyone liked Tom's surprise—except Mother!
